    "body": "## Problem\n\nDescribe the problem (concisely).\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```\nnvim --clean\n```\n\nput some multicursor then `cw<c-r>-`.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5e614fae-79fc-4bf7-bcbd-d88ae68a73dc\n\n## Expected behavior\nVisual display should be correct after `cw<c-r>-`\n\n## System info\n\n- Nvim version (nvim -v): `v0.13.0-dev-1600 g4cad27fbcf` neovim/neovim@4cad27fbcf\n- Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?: ?\n- Operating system/version: Linux 7.1.8-zen1-3-zen\n- Terminal name/version: kitty\n- $TERM environment variable: `xterm-kitty`\n- Installation: ?\n\n",
